  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001136",
        "SRC-001148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Coastal Commission staff report: two-story mixed-use building on a 14,551 sq ft site (APNs 023-013-010 and 023-013-020) in the Pedro Point area, 2,292 sq ft ground-floor commercial space and four apartments on the second floor; two unused barns to be demolished. The Planning Commission approved CDP-409-19 on 2020-05-04; on appeal the applicant reduced the project from three stories and six units to two stories and four units, which the City Council approved on 2020-11-09.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The state report lists building permits for 6 units under 1300 Danmann issued 2022-06-23 (2022 to 2024 rows; 2023 note: inspections in progress; 2024 note: permit ready to be issued). Its 2025 permit (2025-02-20) and certificate of occupancy (2025-05-14) rows are for a separate ADU at 1200 Danmann Ave, tracking number 59871-25, on the same parcel.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001148"
      ]
    },
    {
